#10100
Behind the Waterfall~
   A waterfall rushes down, partially screening the passageway across the
chasm to the north. The falling water causes a great deal of mist of rise,
drenching the mossy rocks, and making for poor footing on this narrow ledge.
Below, the torrent of water disappears into the darkness, splashing down over
the rocks.
~
