The Bottom of the Slide~
   Your feet slip out from under you as you try to descend the treacherous
incline. A startled scream slips from between your clenched teeth as you
plummet downward. After a short, rough ride, you stand dazed and battered at
to bottom of the slide. Judging from the bones protruding from the mud, you're
not the first to have been trapped here.
~
